Z||000000||RossT||10-13-2001||10:40 PM||||Well today Jsocha and RossT got together to inspect Jeff's new black Texan 86gt, and RossT's friends Lambo.. stretch kit.  It's been about 5 months since my last update and much of the car is back to gether. A wheel alignment has been done, and the car is now driveable. The cops even got into the action by promptly giving jason a ticket while he was trying to calibrate his speedomiter in front of the shop.  Something about driving an unsafe car???  Does this car look unsafe to you guys????<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image007_4.jpg">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image008_4.jpg">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image010_2.jpg">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image011_2.jpg">   <p>[This message has been edited by RossT (edited 10-13-2001).]||||reg||1
